# UI verification with Playwright

Whenever you make UI changes in this project:

1. Start or reuse the local Next.js Dev server (`npm run dev`).
2. Inspect the result with Playwright (user-playwright MCP or `npm run test:e2e`) before considering the work done.
3. Confirm the affected pages look correct (snapshot/screenshot), links and layout work, and the console has no new errors.

Do not claim UI work is complete without this verification.
